# Licence

This repository holds two different kinds of work, and they are licensed
differently. Read whichever applies to what you want to use.

---

## 1. Code — MIT Licence

Applies to everything that is software: the lab source files (`labs/**`), the
site (`src/**`), the build, validation and publishing scripts (`scripts/**`),
the configuration (`config/**`, `curriculum/**`) and the tests (`tests/**`).

```
